WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:01.920
¿Qué está sucediendo?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:05.960
Your phone.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:11.800
Yeah?

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:15.200
Charlotte?

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.520
It's your father.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.280
He’s come to.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:29.760
Hey.

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:33.560
Can’t you really give me

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:34.520
one last chance?

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.320
I was in so much pain, Robert.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.200
Very well then,

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:48.920
and I...

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:50.800
wish you well.
